{"id":"665574","name":"胡萝卜鸭腿汤","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/665574/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭腿","amount":"1只"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸭腿洗净并浸泡出血。","img":"images/665574/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成块状。","img":"images/665574/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"入锅焯水，加入适量的料酒。","img":"images/665574/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出鸭肉块。","img":"images/665574/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮，切斜片待用。","img":"images/665574/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中放入姜丝，胡萝卜。","img":"images/665574/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐，放入焯好的鸭腿煮制10分钟。","img":"images/665574/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛入碗中，加入葱花即可，汤鲜肉嫩，营养丰富。","img":"images/665574/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"鸭腿先焯至无水血再做。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}